&lt;h2 id=&#34;修改飞牛ip-挂载媒体库并配置影视应用&#34;&gt;修改飞牛IP 挂载媒体库并配置影视应用
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;一路按需设置即可，需要注意的是进系统设置的第一个账号默认为有 SSH 权限的且不可删除的管理员账号，DHCP 获取的 IP 地址不满意，可以进系统后手动指定。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_network.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1136&#34;
	height=&#34;879&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_network_hu_c0e625f07b8f59f7.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_network_hu_45aefa5e83475e9b.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;129&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;310px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;接着简单安装下影视应用，将unraid 里的影音库目录 挂载到飞牛OS，并共享给影视应用。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_smb1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1369&#34;
	height=&#34;813&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_smb1_hu_7635ca95b8adc80b.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_smb1_hu_56953bb9d4c1934f.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;smb挂载&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;168&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;404px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_smb2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1389&#34;
	height=&#34;836&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_smb2_hu_a134ab141a2a64db.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_smb2_hu_fe0948758fbd19a8.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;共享影视目录&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;166&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;398px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;进入影视，设置下自己目录对应的媒体分类，稍等片刻，即可挂削完毕&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2560&#34;
	height=&#34;1266&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video1_hu_ba93a0ac4204f7b8.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video1_hu_b41e50e11898ccac.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;202&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;485px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2560&#34;
	height=&#34;1266&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video2_hu_ca91264f91d299e1.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video2_hu_6bd41d548c25b292.png 1024w&#34;
