		data-flex-basis=&#34;485px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;可以看到飞牛的播放器完成度还是比较高的，个人感觉比 emby 和 jellyfin 的网页版易用点&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video3.png&#34;
	width=&#34;2560&#34;
	height=&#34;1266&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video3_hu_c22fb93aa6ca0d6f.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_video3_hu_18a91f78c719cb5c.png 1024w&#34;
