&lt;h2 id=&#34;核显直通转码&#34;&gt;核显直通转码
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;unraid 下直通核显比较简单，首先去Tools - System Devices 找到并勾选核显，Bind selected to VFIO at Boot，并重启。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode1.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1786&#34;
	height=&#34;117&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode1_hu_28089d0d3c66b979.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode1_hu_6d51e938d34e2547.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;1526&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;3663px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;接着将暂停飞牛虚拟机，将设置的显卡从 VNC 改成 你的核显重启虚拟机即可&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode2.png&#34;
	width=&#34;822&#34;
	height=&#34;434&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode2_hu_f3f80be42bf33fc0.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode2_hu_85e225d8db825bc4.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;189&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;454px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;最后，在飞牛影视里 勾选启用 GPU 加速转码即可&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode3.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1656&#34;
	height=&#34;1173&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode3_hu_bac314ada57b9c8.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode3_hu_2759e3b5b05580de.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;141&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;338px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode4.png&#34;
	width=&#34;793&#34;
	height=&#34;223&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode4_hu_6b8c3062cc8c3c7e.png 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode4_hu_8c214b1d2fc9f855.png 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;355&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;853px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我们把手机上切成流量，模拟在外面访问家里的nas，需要转码的情况，可以看到已经成功驱动。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode5.PNG&#34;
	width=&#34;1334&#34;
	height=&#34;750&#34;
	srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode5_hu_12ab65ca31466ef9.PNG 480w, http://localhost:1313/p/fnos_unraid/FNOS_VM_transcode5_hu_d0d1ba295521f8bd.PNG 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;177&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;426px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;简单总结&#34;&gt;简单总结
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;飞牛OS 目前专业性功能还比不上老牌NAS系统如群晖等，但也已经有相对出色的影音体验，足以应对家用非专业用户的使用。安装简单不挑硬件，正版免费也是最大的优势，也许有一天能让黑群晖成为过去式，变成国产DIY NAS 首先推荐的系统。如果有一天我要拆开 unraid，进行存算分离，我可能会考虑买成品NAS或者实体机安装飞牛使用。&lt;/p&gt;
